ent-WeaponTurretHeavyMonolithic = corrupted heavy ballistic turret
    .desc = A massively reinforced turret, firing a barrage of anti-material 7.62x51mm rounds that rip up targets and mechs alike. This one's bio-signature sensors seem to be corrupted.
